Each file is licensed as stated in its own header (SPDX-License-Identifier
line or license notice). The full text of every license is in the LICENSES/
directory. This file summarizes the licenses of the files built by setup.py
(SWIG module UeiDaq: UeiDaq.py and the _UeiDaq extension compiled from the
generated UeiDaqPy_wrap.cpp, linked with libUeiDaq). If this summary and a
file header disagree, the file header applies.


