   SWIG typemaps compiled into _UeiDaq (default build, NUMPYVER unset):
   numpy.i

   SWIG typemaps used only when NUMPYVER==2:
   numpy2.i

   [REVIEW NOTE - remove before commit] numpy.i is the NumPy project's SWIG
   typemap file but has no license header in this tree (numpy2.i carries
   the NumPy BSD-3-Clause header). Replace numpy.i with the upstream copy
   including its header, or switch to numpy2.i.


External components (not included in this directory)
----------------------------------------------------
UeiDaqPy_wrap.cpp is generated by SWIG at build time and includes SWIG
library code (typemaps.i, std_string.i, runtime). SWIG's license places no
restrictions on generated output. The _UeiDaq extension dynamically links
libUeiDaq.so (libueidaq) and requires numpy (python3-numpy, BSD-3-Clause)
at runtime.


Files not built/installed for the ARM (SoloX) target
----------------------------------------------------
Examples/ (Python examples, PyQt and wx samples), Python Documentation.txt,
UeiDaq.pth, build.bat/build.sh and UeiDaqPython/ (Visual Studio projects)
are not installed by setup.py and are not covered by this summary.



